    LLM: 'Game: 52 Pick-up. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '52 Pick-up is a social prank using a standard pack: one player offers a game, scatters the cards, and the other player is left to pick them up. It is recorded as a social card-game joke rather than a strategic contest.',
    objective: 'Miners try to complete a path to the gold while saboteurs try to prevent the route before the deck runs out.',
    gameplay: 'Players receive secret roles and hands of path or action cards. On each turn a player plays a path card, plays an action card to help or hinder, or discards and draws. The round score depends on whether a valid path reaches the treasure.',
